{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34413","headline":"奉和袭美送李明府之任南海 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美送李明府之任南海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春尽之官直到秋，岭云深处凭泷楼。\n居人爱近沈珠浦，候吏多来拾翠洲。\n賨税尽应输紫贝，蛮童多学佩金钩。\n知君不恋南枝久，抛却经冬白罽裘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}